                           ***  NEWS RELEASE  ***

----------------------------------------------------------------------------
        February 15, 1994             For immediate release.
----------------------------------------------------------------------------

Following the banning of five Internet newsgroups at the University of
Waterloo (UW) on February 1, 1994, the UW Graduate Student Association
(GSA) Board of Directors passed the follow motion at a meeting Monday
February 14:

"Be it resolved that the GSA initiate a petition calling on the university
administration to reinstate the banned newsgroups."

"Be it further resolved that this [to be released] petition be distributed
to all UW campus community members, subsequent to electronic approval of
the board"

The final wording of the petition is currently being determined by the GSA
executive and, subject to Board approval, should be available later this week.
